id: pm-rust-oracle-2026-10-23
title: Match pm-cli 2026.10.23 relationship packet behaviour
description: "Classify the 11 orientation differential failures in PR #122 against release notes, port documented changes without weakening comparisons, and verify local and PR gates."
type: Task
status: blocked
priority: 2
tags[3]: conformance,"gh:unbraind/pm-rust#122",oracle
created_at: "2026-10-27T00:42:20.194Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T01:57:19.853Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: "Classify each of the 11 original failures against the 2026.10.22 and 2026.10.23 contracts; retain exact oracle stdout, stderr and status comparisons; add focused native regressions; report local gates and PR CI; push fixes to the existing Dependabot branch without merging."
parent: pm-rust-s6j4
risk: medium
confidence: 90
blocked_by: pm-rust-oracle-frozen-restart
blocked_reason: Relationship changes are implemented and verified; the bumped oracle independently breaks the unchanged crash-restart gate under the deterministic clock fixture.
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
